    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dumb AF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Dumb AF</i>, a <strong>3D</strong>, <strong>Stylized</strong> platformer where every jump, tumble, and laugh takes you one step closer to the mysterious pyramid. In this <strong>challenging</strong> adventure, you'll navigate a world filled with absurd obstacles,\u00a0 and physics-defying surprises. One misstep or an unfortunate brush with the relentless sandstorms, and your journey meets a hilariously untimely end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to experience gameplay that's as <strong>goofy</strong> and <strong>funny</strong> as it is intense. The levels are designed to keep you on your toes\u2014each stage is a masterclass in engineered absurdity that tests your reflexes, timing, and wit. Conquer treacherous paths, dodge unpredictable traps, and harness your inner courage to beat every challenge in this crazy race to the pyramid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to defy gravity and logic in a world where every moment is a blend of chaotic fun and unforgiving obstacles? Your destiny lies at the pyramid\u2019s summit, but only if you can laugh through the madness. Embrace the absurd ride of <i>Dumb AF</i> and show the world that being a little dumb might just be your smartest move!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dumb AF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Dumb AF</i>, a <strong>3D</strong>, <strong>Stylized</strong> platformer where every jump, tumble, and laugh takes you one step closer to the mysterious pyramid. In this <strong>challenging</strong> adventure, you'll navigate a world filled with absurd obstacles,\u00a0 and physics-defying surprises. One misstep or an unfortunate brush with the relentless sandstorms, and your journey meets a hilariously untimely end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to experience gameplay that's as <strong>goofy</strong> and <strong>funny</strong> as it is intense. The levels are designed to keep you on your toes\u2014each stage is a masterclass in engineered absurdity that tests your reflexes, timing, and wit. Conquer treacherous paths, dodge unpredictable traps, and harness your inner courage to beat every challenge in this crazy race to the pyramid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to defy gravity and logic in a world where every moment is a blend of chaotic fun and unforgiving obstacles? Your destiny lies at the pyramid\u2019s summit, but only if you can laugh through the madness. Embrace the absurd ride of <i>Dumb AF</i> and show the world that being a little dumb might just be your smartest move!</p>",
